20:["$","p","Naming all three matters. People often try to solve burnout with a holiday, then feel defeated when the cynicism returns in week one. Exhaustion responds to rest; the other two respond to changes in demand, control, and meaning.",{"className":"text-base leading-relaxed text-body","children":"Naming all three matters. People often try to solve burnout with a holiday, then feel defeated when the cynicism returns in week one. Exhaustion responds to rest; the other two respond to changes in demand, control, and meaning."}]
21:["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-serif text-xl text-ink","children":"Symptom mechanics"}],[["$","p","Under sustained load, cortisol regulation shifts. Recovery becomes slower and less complete, so each week starts from a deficit. The body adapts by lowering engagement — that flatness is protective, not lazy.",{"className":"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body","children":"Under sustained load, cortisol regulation shifts. Recovery becomes slower and less complete, so each week starts from a deficit. The body adapts by lowering engagement — that flatness is protective, not lazy."}],["$","p","Genuine recovery needs both a reduction in demand and active restoration: sleep, movement, connection, and time where no one needs anything from you. One without the other stalls.",{"className":"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body","children":"Genuine recovery needs both a reduction in demand and active restoration: sleep, movement, connection, and time where no one needs anything from you. One without the other stalls."}]]]}]
